<title>SOUTH KOREA: S.Korea group seeks loans, but says not in trouble.</title>
<headline>S.Korea group seeks loans, but says not in trouble.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Korea's New Core Group, the 25th largest conglomerate, denied on Thursday a local news report that it was in serious financial trouble and said it was discussing with creditors involving normal business loans.</p>
<p>New Core, a distribution and retailing giant, has 18 affiliates, none of which is listed.</p>
